{"suttaId":"tha-ap430","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[335,437],"vripara":"107"},"segments":{"tha-ap430:0.3":"Sucintitattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap430:1.1":"“Nagare haṃsavatiyā, ahosiṃ kassako tadā;","tha-ap430:1.3":"Kasikammena jīvāmi, tena posemi dārake.","tha-ap430:2.1":"“Susampannaṃ tadā khettaṃ, dhaññaṃ me phalinaṃ [phalitaṃ (sī. pī.)] ahu;","tha-ap430:2.3":"Pākakāle ca sampatte, evaṃ cintesahaṃ tadā.","tha-ap430:3.1":"“Nacchannaṃ nappatirūpaṃ, jānantassa guṇāguṇaṃ;","tha-ap430:3.3":"Yohaṃ saṅghe adatvāna, aggaṃ bhuñjeyya ce tadā [mattanā (syā.)].","tha-ap430:4.1":"“Ayaṃ buddho asamasamo, dvattiṃsavaralakkhaṇo;","tha-ap430:4.3":"Tato pabhāvito saṅgho, puññakkhetto anuttaro.","tha-ap430:5.1":"“Tattha dassāmahaṃ dānaṃ, navasassaṃ pure pure;","tha-ap430:5.3":"Evāhaṃ cintayitvāna, haṭṭho pīṇitamānaso [pītika …(syā.)].","tha-ap430:6.1":"“Khettato dhaññamāhatvā, sambuddhaṃ upasaṅkamiṃ;","tha-ap430:6.3":"Upasaṅkamma sambuddhaṃ, lokajeṭṭhaṃ narāsabhaṃ;","tha-ap430:6.5":"Vanditvā satthuno pāde, idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ.","tha-ap430:7.1":"“‘Navasassañca sampannaṃ, āyāgosi [idha hosi (syā.)] ca tvaṃ mune;","tha-ap430:7.3":"Anukampamupādāya, adhivāsehi cakkhuma’.","tha-ap430:8.1":"“Padumuttaro lokavidū, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho;","tha-ap430:8.3":"Mama saṅkappamaññāya, idaṃ vacanamabravi.","tha-ap430:9.1":"“‘Cattāro ca paṭipannā, cattāro ca phale ṭhitā;","tha-ap430:9.3":"Esa saṅgho ujubhūto, paññāsīlasamāhito;","tha-ap430:9.5":"Yajantānaṃ manussānaṃ, puññapekkhāna pāṇinaṃ.","tha-ap430:10.1":"“‘Karotopadhikaṃ puññaṃ, saṅghe dinnaṃ mahapphalaṃ;","tha-ap430:10.3":"Tasmiṃ saṅgheva [saṃghe ca (syā. pī.)] dātabbaṃ, tava sassaṃ tathetaraṃ.","tha-ap430:11.1":"“‘Saṅghato uddisitvāna, bhikkhū netvāna saṃgharaṃ;","tha-ap430:11.3":"Paṭiyattaṃ ghare santaṃ, bhikkhusaṅghassa dehi tvaṃ’.","tha-ap430:12.1":"“Saṅghato uddisitvāna, bhikkhū netvāna saṃgharaṃ;","tha-ap430:12.3":"Yaṃ ghare paṭiyattaṃ me, bhikkhusaṅghassadāsahaṃ.","tha-ap430:13.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap430:13.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap430:14.1":"“Tattha me sukataṃ byamhaṃ, sovaṇṇaṃ sappabhassaraṃ;","tha-ap430:14.3":"Saṭṭhiyojanamubbedhaṃ, tiṃsayojanavitthataṃ.","tha-ap430:15.1":"Ekūnavīsatimaṃ bhāṇavāraṃ.","tha-ap430:16.1":"“Ākiṇṇaṃ bhavanaṃ mayhaṃ, nārīgaṇasamākulaṃ;","tha-ap430:16.3":"Tattha bhutvā pivitvā ca, vasāmi tidase ahaṃ.","tha-ap430:17.1":"“Satānaṃ tīṇikkhattuñca, devarajjamakārayiṃ;","tha-ap430:17.3":"Satānaṃ pañcakkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ;","tha-ap430:17.5":"Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ.","tha-ap430:18.1":"“Bhavābhave saṃsaranto, labhāmi amitaṃ dhanaṃ;","tha-ap430:18.3":"Bhoge me ūnatā natthi, navasassassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap430:19.1":"“Hatthiyānaṃ assayānaṃ, sivikaṃ sandamānikaṃ;","tha-ap430:19.3":"Labhāmi sabbamevetaṃ [sabbametampi (ka.)], navasassassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap430:20.1":"“Navavatthaṃ navaphalaṃ, navaggarasabhojanaṃ;","tha-ap430:20.3":"Labhāmi sabbamevetaṃ, navasassassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap430:21.1":"“Koseyyakambaliyāni, khomakappāsikāni ca;","tha-ap430:21.3":"Labhāmi sabbamevetaṃ, navasassassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap430:22.1":"“Dāsīgaṇaṃ dāsagaṇaṃ, nāriyo ca alaṅkatā;","tha-ap430:22.3":"Labhāmi sabbamevetaṃ, navasassassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap430:23.1":"“Na maṃ sītaṃ vā uṇhaṃ vā, pariḷāho na vijjati;","tha-ap430:23.3":"Atho cetasikaṃ dukkhaṃ, hadaye me na vijjati.","tha-ap430:24.1":"“Idaṃ khāda idaṃ bhuñja, imamhi sayane saya;","tha-ap430:24.3":"Labhāmi sabbamevetaṃ, navasassassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap430:25.1":"“Ayaṃ pacchimako dāni, carimo vattate bhavo;","tha-ap430:25.3":"Ajjāpi deyyadhammo me, phalaṃ tosesi sabbadā.","tha-ap430:26.1":"“Navasassaṃ daditvāna, saṅghe gaṇavaruttame;","tha-ap430:26.3":"Aṭṭhānisaṃse anubhomi, kammānucchavike mama.","tha-ap430:27.1":"“Vaṇṇavā yasavā homi, mahābhogo anītiko;","tha-ap430:27.3":"Mahāpakkho [mahābhakkho (syā. ka.)] sadā homi, abhejjapariso sadā.","tha-ap430:28.1":"“Sabbe maṃ apacāyanti, ye keci pathavissitā;","tha-ap430:28.3":"Deyyadhammā ca ye keci, pure pure labhāmahaṃ.","tha-ap430:29.1":"“Bhikkhusaṅghassa vā majjhe, buddhaseṭṭhassa sammukhā;","tha-ap430:29.3":"Sabbepi samatikkamma, denti mameva dāyakā.","tha-ap430:30.1":"“Paṭhamaṃ navasassañhi, datvā saṅghe gaṇuttame;","tha-ap430:30.3":"Imānisaṃse anubhomi, navasassassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap430:31.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap430:31.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, navasassassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap430:32.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo;","tha-ap430:33.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap430:34.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap430:35.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sucintito thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap430:36.1":"Sucintitattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
